@ref Art 82(3)
GIVEN `the detail` IS AN `Art 82(3) detail`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 82(3) the information must include the detail` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the detail`
    WHEN `Art 82(3) the data necessary for the identification of the AI system concerned` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Art 82(3) the origin of the AI system` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Art 82(3) the supply chain of the AI system` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Art 82(3) the nature of the risk involved` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Art 82(3) the nature and duration of the national measures taken` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Art 82(3) another available detail` THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "all available details, in particular" names five details and does not close the list

