§ `Article 83: the parties and the acts`

DECLARE `Art 83 party` IS ONE OF
    `Art 83 the market surveillance authority`

DECLARE `Art 83 act` IS ONE OF
    `Art 83(1) require the relevant provider to put an end to the non-compliance concerned within a period the authority may prescribe`
    `Art 83(2) take appropriate and proportionate measures to restrict or prohibit the high-risk AI system being made available on the market or to ensure that it is recalled or withdrawn from the market without delay`

§ `Article 83(1): the findings of formal non-compliance, and the requirement to put an end to it`

-- src:1338 | 1. Where the market surveillance authority of a Member State makes one of the following findings, it shall require the relevant provider to put an end to the non-compliance concerned, within a period it may prescribe:
-- src:1339 | (a) the CE marking has been affixed in violation of Article 48;
-- src:1340 | (b) the CE marking has not been affixed;
-- src:1341 | (c) the EU declaration of conformity referred to in Article 47 has not been drawn up;
-- src:1342 | (d) the EU declaration of conformity referred to in Article 47 has not been drawn up correctly;
-- src:1343 | (e) the registration in the EU database referred to in Article 71 has not been carried out;
-- src:1344 | (f) where applicable, no authorised representative has been appointed;
-- src:1345 | (g) technical documentation is not available.
@ref Art 83(1) (src:1338-1345)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority finds that the CE marking has been affixed in violation of Article 48` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority finds that the CE marking has not been affixed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority finds that the EU declaration of conformity referred to in Article 47 has not been drawn up` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority finds that the EU declaration of conformity referred to in Article 47 has not been drawn up correctly` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority finds that the registration in the EU database referred to in Article 71 has not been carried out` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority finds that no authorised representative has been appointed, where applicable` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority finds that technical documentation is not available` IS A BOOLEAN
