§ `Article 84: Union AI testing support structures`

DECLARE `Art 84 party` IS ONE OF
    `Art 84 the Commission`
    `Art 84 a Union AI testing support structure`

DECLARE `Art 84 act` IS ONE OF
    `Art 84(1) designate one or more Union AI testing support structures`
    `Art 84(2) provide independent technical or scientific advice`

